{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29155","headline":"寄献三川守刘公 一 · 许浑","name":"寄献三川守刘公 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三川歌颂彻咸秦，十二楼前侍从臣。\n休闭玉笼留鸑鷟，早开金埒纵麒麟。\n花深穉榻迎何客，月在膺舟醉几人。\n自笑东风过寒食，茂陵寥落未知春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}